      "source": "<code>HttpExchangeAdapterDecorator</code> that suppresses the\n<a href=\"../../../reactive/function/client/WebClientResponseException.NotFound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.function.client\"><code>WebClientResponseException.NotFound</code></a> exception resulting from 404\nresponses and returns a <code>ResponseEntity</code> with the status set to\n<a href=\"../../../../http/HttpStatus.html#NOT_FOUND\"><code>HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND</code></a> status, or an empty\n<code>Mono</code> from <a href=\"../../../reactive/function/client/support/NotFoundWebClientAdapterDecorator.html#exchangeForBodyMono(org.springframework.web.service.invoker.HttpRequestValues,org.springframework.core.ParameterizedTypeReference)\"><code>NotFoundWebClientAdapterDecorator.exchangeForBodyMono(HttpRequestValues, ParameterizedTypeReference)</code></a>.",
